ing incentives so  then they're not even worried about like  think about tops for example they lost  the exclusive license and they lost  their entire business literally the  business cratered in value they couldn't  sell these cards because they don't have  the license anymore so they went from a  1.3 billion valuation to selling the  trading card business at 500 million  massive massive massive discount because  their incentives weren't aligned and  they didn't have the exclusive  partnership so the whole goal is like  for reuben is now hey i'm just going to  continue building these businesses with  these leagues that already have good  relationships with and we're going to  create value for not only myself our  shareholders but also these leagues  which has ultimately ended up being like  a really good strategy for him

